        "TileImage": "$($repository 1d794be5-922f-4d84-8be2-4fac6010a4e1).Image",
        "Description": "Our most enigmatic client, the notorious Ben Zenering, has once again sent us a confusing contract. Your targets today are scientists Apuleio Di Lauro and Prudenzio Endrizzi, former employees of Pro-pain pharmaceuticals who recently left the company in favor of the Ether corporation. Those two we understand. Besides them, Mr. Zenering has also requested the termination of a seemingly unrelated bodyguard and sommelier.",
